; A price that states its number but not its currency, where nothing else
; in the transaction decides it, takes the cost currency of the lots its
; account holds, as in beancount's categorize_by_currency.
option "booking_method" "HIFO"
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2020-01-01 open Assets:Stock
2020-01-01 open Equity:Open

2020-01-02 * "Lot a"
  Assets:Stock  10 HOOL {10 USD}
  Equity:Open

2020-01-03 * "Lot b"
  Assets:Stock  10 HOOL {20 USD, "lotb"}
  Equity:Open

2020-02-01 * "Beside an auto-posting"
  Assets:Cash
  Assets:Stock  10 HOOL @ 1.5

2020-02-02 * "Zero units at an empty cost spec"
  Assets:Stock  0 HOOL {} @ 5

2020-02-03 balance Assets:Cash   -15.0 USD
2020-02-03 balance Assets:Stock  30 HOOL
